              "type": "text",
              "text": "Results of the SSC Composite Supplementary Examinations held by Aga Khan University Examination Board (AKU-EB) in July 2007 were announced at mid night on August 6, 2007."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Copies of the results will be couriered to schools by August 7, 2007. Candidates and schools can also access these results online."
